              <div class="desc-itm" data-aos="fade-up">
                <p class="nw-w-txt-2 mb-3" data-aos="fade-up">
                  A crypto market-making bot is an automated trading system that continuously places buy and sell orders
                  on both sides of an exchange's order book by creating liquidity, narrowing bid-ask spreads, and
                  earning the spread difference as profit. Our AI market-making bots are trained on live market data,
                  continuously adjusting spread widths, order sizes, quote depths, and rebalancing frequency based on
                  real-time conditions.
                </p>
                <p class="nw-w-txt-2 mb-3" data-aos="fade-up">
                  As a dedicated crypto market-making bot development company, Clarisco Solutions builds bots that
                  operate across centralized exchanges (Binance, OKX, Kraken, Bybit) and decentralized protocols
                  (Uniswap v3, dYdX, Hyperliquid) with full source code ownership, no platform lock-in, and post-launch
                  support included.
                </p>
